# Edit, commit, and deploy

1. All editing happens in this Cursor project.
2. Do not commit or push until the user explicitly says the changes are finished, checked, and approved.
3. Do not pull onto the Lightsail server, and do not redeploy, until the user explicitly instructs that.

The Lightsail app that was built yesterday lives at `/home/ubuntu/au-roof-scanner`. A later copy under `/opt/au-roof-scanner` is not the source of truth.
